item.description:
Listen to audiobook in full for free : <br><a href="https://amzn.to/4hopIfn">https://amzn.to/4hopIfn</a> <br><br>Title: Happiness Framed [Russian Edition]: The Art of Capturing Life in the Perfect Light by Rodion Vishnevsky<br>Author: Rodion  Vishnevsky<br>Narrator: Daniil  Teplov<br>Length: 2:26:04<br>Release date: 09-05-2025<br>Publisher: Authors Republic<br>Genres: Self Development, Health & Wellness<br>Language: English<br><br>Description:<br>Imagine your consciousness is the most perfect camera in the world. With every moment, it takes millions of shots, but your inner settings determine which ones make it into your personal 'life photo album.' Like a practical manual based on twenty years of professional photography experience, this audiobook will teach you to use basic photography principles to create masterpieces from your everyday life.
You'll learn how to:
• Shift your focus from problems to opportunities by managing your perception;
• Properly prioritize in life to concentrate on what matters most;
• Find something good in any day, using difficulties as a source of personal growth;
• Reframe painful events, extracting valuable lessons while releasing negative emotions;
• Create a personal archive of positive moments to have instant access to sources of strength and inspiration.
After listening to this audiobook, you'll understand that you're no longer a passive observer of what happens — now you're an active creator of your own happiness. It doesn't matter what yesterday's shots looked like. Failures aren't a reason to give up, but an opportunity to practice 'shooting against the light' technique. Crisis is a chance to practice creating conditions for personal growth.
The studio of your new life is open 24/7. Don't wait for perfect conditions — create them yourself by experimenting with perception settings and finding interesting angles in familiar situations.
Capture fleeting moments of beauty, live with gratitude, see the world through an artist's eyes — and you'll see life in a completely different light!<br><br>#ad Disclosure: As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases.

